br>
<br>
* When:  WED, May 2, 2001, 8:30 pm cent<br>
NOTE:  at this time we will enter the tower, so if you plan on going 8:30 is not the time to start looking for a port etc.<br>
<br>
*Level Limit:  40+ (see note below for 30+ regarding floors 2/3)<br>
<br>
*Sign up will be BB _only_.  This is my policy for raids and I believe will soon be set in stone as a guild raiding policy.  The main reason is so as people sign up groups can be pre-formed and other people's input can be given.  I don't wanna be pulling my hair out at the last minute as peeps show up and stick them in a wrong group etc., then hear later OMG those groups sucked, imbalanced, etc. <br>
<br>
Before I add any more, I need to see who has interest etc.  We must have 1) tank 2)wizard/druid (porters/keyholders/evacers) 3) healer/IVU  <br>
<br>
*Note:  At this time none of us that I know of have been past 3rd floor, and maps are elusive and ambiguous at best.  So, if we are unable to form a scouting party before hand the purpose of this raid will be to scout and learn, adventure new place together, lewt (always lewt &lt;grin&gt;) and, hopefully exp - THIS IS NOT AN EXP RAID.  If we have 1 group expect experience, if we don't, please don't and if you get bored please say so and you are free to leave. <br>
<br>
I plan on going from 8:30 pm to around 10pm - at that time there will be a break - we will port out and meet up at the gnoll igloos - to drop off/pick up anyone that signed and can't play until that time, and divvy up (lewt call).   From that point I plan on going from about 10pm to 11:30 pm cent (only becuase I'll have to log so if you all wanna go longer that's great)when we will again port out and lewt call.  Note: we will only continue if the keyholders do not have to log.<br>
<br>
I am trying this weekday thing to see how it goes, and tried to pick a time when I know everyone (or darn near) can attend if they want.  I also implemented Zilben's idea of a set break time to pick up/drop off people - so we'll see how this works.  <br>
<br>
*One more suggestion:  If people 30+ would like to raid 2-3rd floors again this would be great as the bowl never dropped and some could still use syllabus - so - if you are interested please sign up. <br>
<br>
Please sign up as follows:<br>
<br>
1.  name, lvl <br>
2.  If you are keyholder and what floor key you have<br>
3.  what part of raid you will attend (whole, 1st half, 2nd half)<br>
<br>
Ok, it for now.  <br>
<br>
*Tressia<br>
<br>
<br>
<br>
<br>
<br>
 <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/ubelnorsilverheart.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Belnor Silverheart</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/18/01 9:11:09 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=34.topic&index=1>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: TOFS Floors 4+</span><hr size=1> Belnor 44 cleric will be there for the entire raid. Do not have a key to any of the floors.<br>
<br>
Belnor Silverheart<br>
Cleric of Tunare <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uzilben.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Zilben</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/18/01 11:55:45 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=34.topic&index=2>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: TOFS Floors 4+</span><hr size=1> If I'm working, I'll try to get it off, if I can't I get home about the time the raid will begin so I'll camp inside the first floor of the tower before hand, so I'd be there exactly the time it would start, 9:30pm EST.<br>
<br>
If no working, me be there for sure.<br>
<br>
And peeps, as a warning, there is a good chance anyone might die on this raid, please come embracing the fact you may die, and if it doesn't happen, we have reason to celebrate.<br>
Mainly because on the 4th floor, there are traps, secrets, and lvl 40+ mobs from what I'm aware of.<br>
<br>
This isn't too scare you, just be aware of what you're getting into, I'm fully prepared to die and/or fall into a trap etc. Sacrifice for the whole is the noblest of sacrifices. <!--EZCODE EMOTICON START :) --><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/intl/aenglish/images/emoticons/smile.gif ALT=":)"><!--EZCODE EMOTICON END--> <br>
<br>
And if you do die, stiffen that upper lip and shake it off, it's all in good fun after all. Your leg didn't get chewed off in Real Life anyways...<br>
<br>
&quot;Burn them all and ask questions later as I always say...&quot;<br>
<br>
Zilben, Apprentice Channeler of the 50th Circle<br>
Aka: Hey you! <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> tyho</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/18/01 1:27:57 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=34.topic&index=3>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> TOFS4</span><hr size=1> Tyho, 31 count me in for the first sceduled time up to 3rd floor, ( no keys on me btw ) really enjoyed the last TOFS raid i participated in and expect to enjoy this one as well....see you all there ). <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/ussolaria.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Ssolaria</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/18/01 3:56:20 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=34.topic&index=4>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> I will be there</span><hr size=1> Level 39 Wizzie<br>
