 <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Tressia</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/24/01 7:17:02 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=34.topic&index=12>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> babble</span><hr size=1> Coolies Exidor, that's pretty much why I planned it with that break time.<br>
<br>
 <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uexidorgangleri.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Exidor Gangleri</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/24/01 7:26:28 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=34.topic&index=13>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: babble</span><hr size=1> Just for us???<br>
