Any input? <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Tressia</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/24/01 7:39:23 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=34.topic&index=14>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> scooby snacks</span><hr size=1> Well I did have you guys in mind (i.e. the break)and I know sometimes others get on later as well.  However as per the above I won't be able stay as late so anyone on raid can feel free to take over and keep it going. <br>
<br>
