 <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/ucamaenluclin.showPublicProfile?language=EN>CamaenLuclin</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/26/01 6:06:09 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=34.topic&index=15>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: scooby snacks</span><hr size=1> im a level 5 bard i would love to go<br>
and tressia you will just have to call in sick. we all must make our sacrifices for the god of eq<br>
 <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Tressia</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/26/01 6:56:20 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=34.topic&index=16>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> key farming</span><hr size=1> Ok, we now have 2 complete sets of keys to floors 2-4, and so far a total of 11 people have signed up.  <br>
<br>
*The raid will proceed as above mentioned<br>
<br>
*To get through the magic portals/doors there must be a keyholder in each group.  This means that as of right now 2 groups can go to the 4th floor.  Because of this important fact the bb sign up rule will be adhered to more strictly.  However, if someone is going to be late or cannot make it please let us know so we can try and find a replacement.  NOTE:  We will not be able to add people past 2 full groups ~ spots will be held for those who are joining at the break<br>
<br>
*Yeah, what zilben said! This is going to be pretty much an exploration raid, with exp and loot as side benefits, and since this will be a new area to all of us it will definately be dangerous. 4th floor is the crypt.<br>
<br>
*I will add a post later with a loot list and what mob drops the key to 5th floor.<br>
<br>
*Loot: most people know how I loot now, we'll have ML in each group and have loot calls, NBG applies.  However, if no one in group or guild needs, (I will not consider alts) then _all_ will roll (and this is for any Phat lewt).  My objective in looting is fairness to everyone.<br>
<br>
*Please research this a little bit yourselves, i.e. what kind mobs, what lvl, what drops, etc.  I was able to find an unmarked map of this floor so not sure that will be any use at all.  <br>
<br>
*Bat wings:  i need to research this again, but as Zilben said I believe this floor has false floors.  I want everyone kept levved for safety - so we might wanna stock up on bat wings prior.  I believe we will have - 6 people present who can lev (Procyon, Bastvani, Exidor, Tressia, Zilben, Ssolaria) <br>
<br>
*People signed up so far:<br>
Tressia - 45 ranger - keys 2-4<br>
Zilben  - 51 wiz<br>
Jaqal - 46 chanter<br>
Belnor - 45 cleric<br>
Tooh - 45 pali<br>
Procyn - 51 druid<br>
Ssolaria - 40 wiz - keys 2-4<br>
Exidor - 45 ranger<br>
Bastvani - 45 druid<br>
Northice - 49 shaman<br>
*Tyho - 31 monk (Tyho - no one else in 30s has signed up and there are no more keys, I will leave it open to group agreeemnt if you wish to join us however mob lvl on 4 is 40s I believe and you would be grouped with peeps 45-50/51.  You might want to conisder recruiting more 30s for floors 2-3 but you will need to obtain keys.) <br>
<br>
*Ok that's all for now until I can think of more.  <br>
